[E-MUTUAL-KIND] Error: `Ask` and `Box` refer to each other, but an ability can't be defined together with what it uses
   ╭─[ reject/mutual-ability.sw:5:9 ]
   │
 5 │ ability Ask where
   │         ─┬─  
   │          ╰─── `Ask` is defined here
   │ 
 8 │ type Box: Type =
   │      ─┬─  
   │       ╰─── `Box` is defined here
   │ 
   │ Note 1: `Ask` uses `Box`, which uses `Ask`
   │ 
   │ Note 2: an ability's operations can't mention a type or definition that uses the ability: a stored computation could then call itself forever (Landin's knot)
───╯
